cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: >-
  AnomalyBench: a reproducible benchmarking suite for anomaly detection
  algorithms
abstract: >-
  AnomalyBench is a Python research package that bundles anomaly detection
  algorithms, benchmark dataset loaders, and a command line interface for
  comparing detectors on standard datasets under a single reproducible protocol.
  It covers classical, ensemble, deep, streaming, graph, forecasting, and modern
  tabular detectors behind a uniform fit/score lifecycle, evaluates them with
  configurable ranking and threshold metrics, and records a manifest of package
  version, random seed, configuration hash, and dataset integrity hashes so that
  reported results can be reproduced.
